1
00:00:00,640 --> 00:00:02,560
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Carol came back home from school.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,660
When she went inside her house, she saw

3
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:08,080
a trail of ants.

4
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:10,680
The trail was so long.

5
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:14,480
There must have been over a thousand ants.

6
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:16,580
She was scared.

7
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:19,520
She slowly walked around it.

8
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:22,280
Where did it all start?

9
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:24,680
What are they after?

10
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:27,300
She followed the trail.

11
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:31,240
She ended up in her bedroom.

12
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:34,420
What would they want in there?

13
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:37,060
She looked at her bed.

14
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:40,120
There were cracker crumbs.

15
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:43,420
She never ate in her bed, though.

16
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:45,840
She looked at the package.

17
00:00:46,680 --> 00:00:48,780
It was her brother's crackers.

18
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:51,800
She ran to her brother's room.

19
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:54,500
Did you see what you did?

20
00:00:55,060 --> 00:00:56,160
Carol asked.

21
00:00:56,800 --> 00:00:58,280
Her brother shook his head.

22
00:00:59,020 --> 00:01:01,840
Carol showed him the ant trail and told

23
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:03,500
him to clean it up.
